# OCR Service Test Data - Tables .gitignore
#
# This file specifies which document files should be excluded from version control
# to prevent repository bloat while ensuring that documentation and configuration
# files are properly tracked.

# Exclude all binary document files by default
*.pdf
*.PDF
*.tiff
*.TIFF
*.tif
*.TIF
*.png
*.PNG
*.jpg
*.JPG
*.jpeg
*.JPEG

# Exclude large data files
*.zip
*.ZIP
*.tar.gz
*.TAR.GZ

# Exclude temporary files
*.tmp
*~

# Keep all README files and documentation
!README.md
!README.txt
!*.md

# Keep configuration files
!*.json
!*.yaml
!*.yml
!*.config

# Keep metadata files
!metadata.csv
!table_definitions.csv
!annotations.csv

# INSTRUCTIONS FOR TEST DOCUMENTS WITH TABULAR DATA
#
# The actual test documents containing tables are not stored in the Git repository to avoid bloat.
# To obtain the test documents for development and testing:
#
# 1. Download the tabular test document package from the secure S3 bucket:
#    s3://mca-documents-staging/test-data/tables.zip
#
# 2. Extract the package to this directory, preserving the folder structure
#
# 3. Run the verification script to ensure all required test documents are present:
#    python ../../verify_test_data.py tables
#
# For more information, see the README.md file in this directory.